Source: pg-mentat
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, clang, rustc, git
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/gburd/pg_mentat

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-mentat
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-mentat
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Datomic-compatible Datalog query engine for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 pg_mentat implements a Datomic-compatible immutable fact store and Datalog
 query engine inside PostgreSQL, including pull queries, time travel, and
 transaction processing through SQL functions. This package builds PostgreSQL
 14 through 18 and keeps the upstream optional script feature disabled.
